## Technical Notes

1. **Documentation Source**: Retrieved latest instructions from https://vercel.com/docs/speed-insights/quickstart
2. **Framework-Specific Implementation**: Used Next.js-specific import path (`@vercel/speed-insights/next`) as per official documentation
3. **Existing Analytics**: Project already had Vercel Analytics installed; Speed Insights was added alongside it without conflicts
4. **Component Placement**: Followed the same pattern as existing Analytics component for consistency

## Next Steps for Deployment

To enable Speed Insights on Vercel:
1. Navigate to your Vercel project dashboard
2. Go to the Speed Insights section
3. Click "Enable" to activate the feature
4. Deploy this code to production
5. Speed Insights will begin collecting performance data after deployment

